<title>NEW ZEALAND: Companies cleared to buy GPG's CMC shares.</title>
<headline>Companies cleared to buy GPG's CMC shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBM Resources Bhd and Central Shore Sdn Bhd said on Friday they had received the consent of the Overseas Investment Commission to acquire up to 35 percent of the shares in Colonial Motor Company from GPG plc.</p>
<p>Accordingly, the acquisition agreements were now unconditional. The agreements were exchanged between the parties earlier on Friday, they said in a statement to the New Zealand Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>MBM and Central Shore each already hold 33.9 percent stakes in CMC.  </p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
